R. Allen Freeze and John A. Cherry. Groundwater, 1979, 604 pages. ISBN 0-13-365312-9. [Groundwater Project's authorized preserved book and downloads](https://gw-project.org/books/groundwater/) · [Complete English edition](https://fc79.gw-project.org/) · [Água Subterrânea, Portuguese edition](https://fc79.gw-project.org/portugues/).

Read the full foundational physical/geological-flow chapters and the relevant recharge, basin, geochemistry, transport, or field-method treatment for the selected study. The whole book is a substantial continuation for a demanding groundwater project. The authorized page provides English and Portuguese reading/downloads, with other translations.

This is an identified historical edition, useful for foundations rather than a promise of current local regulatory or contaminant guidance. Preserve actual edition, translation, and reuse notices; free consultation is distinguished from unrestricted adaptation. Authors, year, length, languages, and authorized access checked on 29 October 2026. No book, translation, or external observation collection is bundled.

